    "english": "Good choice~! Look at / the goods. They're / really great!"
  },
  {
    "resource": 1196,
    "msg_index": 38,
    "japanese": "[03DE]庁[0500]両の[01E8]場には、[0596]店が出ている。",
    "english": "A stall is set up / at the plaza."
  },
  {
    "resource": 1196,
    "msg_index": 39,
    "japanese": "[0596]店をのぞきますか？は いいいえ",
    "english": "Browse the stall? / Yes / No"
  },
  {
    "resource": 1196,
    "msg_index": 40,
    "japanese": "場に毒もないので防ることにした。",
    "english": "Nothing to do here, / so you moved on."
  },
  {
    "resource": 1196,
    "msg_index": 41,
    "japanese": "[001C]商品リスト[001E][04CE][0327]の秘   ３００g[01AB][053F]の秘   ３００g間さな[05EE]   ７００g間力     ６００g[05AB]入をやめる     ",
    "english": "[001C]Product List[001E]\nPotion      300g\nAntidote    300g\nSmall Gem   700g\nStrength    600g\nCancel Purchase"
  },
  {
    "resource": 1196,
    "msg_index": 42,
    "japanese": "いいわよ、[0367]ってあげるわ まいどあり～[0267]",
